# Pull request descriptions

Every PR description must be concise and easy to understand.

- Lead with what changed and why, in one or two short sentences.
- Skip fluff, process narration, and repeated context the diff already shows.
- Prefer plain language over jargon; name user-visible impact when there is any.
- Use a short bullet list only when several distinct changes need separating.
